			<div class="content" id="post-content-4161243">
									

<p>Wowzers. I didn't think I would finish this in one sitting, but here I am an hour and a half later.</p>
<p>This is an amazing piece. Not only does it serve as an examination of character for Dennis, but it also exemplifies the Foundation's treatment of such anomalies. Somehow, in the middle of it, I got to thinking about the years used in the documentation. There was this thought that this wasn't just a timeline of Dennis's health, but kind of also how the writers of the site evolved and changed in the way they wrote their anomalies and containment of them. It might not have been your intention, author, but it was something that I thought about.</p>
<p>All-in-all, I loved this. Excellent work. (though you may want to take a moment to proofread again, just in case)</p>

